    "detailed_description": "You\u2019re just a small-town guy with big pastry dreams \u2014 and this summer, Paris is your playground.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/cff7c8e56d8e06f08a7418ceb2d1e542.poster.avif?t=1755719835\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/cff7c8e56d8e06f08a7418ceb2d1e542.webm?t=1755719835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/cff7c8e56d8e06f08a7418ceb2d1e542.mp4?t=1755719835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As a baking apprentice in one of the city\u2019s most iconic patisseries, you\u2019ll whip up mouth-watering desserts, impress picky customers, and try to win the title of France\u2019s top pastry chef. But it's not just about sugar and flour...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/fb7dd586cab81dde9bcf140ffd9eba2a.poster.avif?t=1755719835\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/fb7dd586cab81dde9bcf140ffd9eba2a.webm?t=1755719835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/fb7dd586cab81dde9bcf140ffd9eba2a.mp4?t=1755719835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You\u2019re living in a luxurious home owned by your wealthy (and very curious) distant relative, meeting gorgeous caf\u00e9 regulars, and making choices that unlock romantic, steamy, and sometimes hilarious stories.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/d7bc094b16b982daa0bbd7b74301197f.poster.avif?t=1755719835\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/d7bc094b16b982daa0bbd7b74301197f.webm?t=1755719835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/d7bc094b16b982daa0bbd7b74301197f.mp4?t=1755719835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>It\u2019s a visual novel with a point-and-click twist, packed with flirty humor, summer vibes, and sweet adult content.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf53 KEY FEATURES</h2><strong>Pure Parisian Summer Vibes</strong><br>Explore the sunny streets, cozy caf\u00e9s, and secret corners of a romanticized, modern-day Paris.<br>\ud83c\udf70 <strong>Dessert-Making Mini-Games</strong><br>Mix, bake, decorate \u2014 and impress! Your skills in the kitchen lead to more than just praise\u2026 they unlock deeper (and hotter) storylines.<br>\ud83d\udc8b <strong>Branching Romance Paths</strong><br>Meet unique girls with distinct personalities and backgrounds. Choose who to bond with \u2014 or chase them all.<br>\ud83c\udfe1 <strong>Life at the Mansion</strong><br>Living with your wealthy cousin? Expect surprises. Clean the house, do chores, or get into a little \u201ctrouble\u201d after hours.<br>\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Play Your Way</strong><br>Focus on love, desserts, or both. Your choices unlock different scenes, routes, and endings. Discover every flavor of this naughty Parisian tale.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/4591e5d6f4c67d4f5e195dbad2160388.poster.avif?t=1755719835\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/4591e5d6f4c67d4f5e195dbad2160388.webm?t=1755719835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/4591e5d6f4c67d4f5e195dbad2160388.mp4?t=1755719835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "You\u2019re just a small-town guy with big pastry dreams \u2014 and this summer, Paris is your playground.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/cff7c8e56d8e06f08a7418ceb2d1e542.poster.avif?t=1755719835\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/cff7c8e56d8e06f08a7418ceb2d1e542.webm?t=1755719835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/cff7c8e56d8e06f08a7418ceb2d1e542.mp4?t=1755719835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As a baking apprentice in one of the city\u2019s most iconic patisseries, you\u2019ll whip up mouth-watering desserts, impress picky customers, and try to win the title of France\u2019s top pastry chef. But it's not just about sugar and flour...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/fb7dd586cab81dde9bcf140ffd9eba2a.poster.avif?t=1755719835\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/fb7dd586cab81dde9bcf140ffd9eba2a.webm?t=1755719835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684690/extras/fb7dd586cab81dde9bcf140ffd9eba2a.mp4?t=1755719835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You\u2019re living in a luxurious home owned by your wealthy (and very curious) distant relative, meeting gorgeous caf\u00e9 regulars, and making choices that unlock romantic, steamy, and sometimes hilarious stories.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea